tremor - destiny
- unique tremor
- when given, set stagger threshold up by 35 (does not stack) every 2 turn.
- if the enemy staggers with this, cause 'tremor burst - destiny'
- expires after [count]×2 turns
- count is for how long its gonna raise it, potency is for how long its gonna stay at that window, if count reaches 0 and potency is still present then the stagger bar stays at that window. when potency expires during count being 0, the stagger window expires back to 0

tremor burst - destiny
- tremor - destiny exclusive
- while its on the enemy,  if theres any destiny debuffs (ex: burn - destiny, rupture - destiny), the person whos attacking the staggerd person gets +1 final power for every 3 destiny debuff potency and count (max +5 final power)

burn - destiny
- unique burn
- at turn star and turn end, (potency)×2 fixed damage
- active untill count expires

bleed - destiny
- unique bleed
- the next time this unit tosses an attack skill coin, take 15 fixed damage
- cannot expire untill another desting debuff expires
- potency increases fixed damage by 2 (max 30)

rupture - destiny
- unique rupture
- the next (x) time(s) the unit is hit or hits tails, take 12 fixed damage
- cannot expire untill a diffrent destiny effect is expired
- potency increases fixed damage by 1 (max 50 fixed)

poise - destiny
- unique poise
- grants a X% chance to crit (10% per count) for 30% more damage. potency -2 on crit or at turn end. (max 200%)
- expires when count expires

sinking - destiny
- unique sinking
- deals ×2 sanity damage equal to count.
- against sp-less enemies, deals ×2 gloom damage instead

